   "id": "2022753797185913015",
   "text": "Example using X:\n\nUser A requests Tweet data \u2192 fetched from X API \u2192 cached.\n\nLater, User B requests the same Tweet data \u2192 served from the shared cache instead of querying X again.\n\nOnly one upstream request. Multiple downstream consumers.\nMarginal cost trends toward zero.",
